# Environment Variables Template
# Copy this file and fill in your actual values

# ==========================================
# FRONTEND (Vite - VITE_ prefix required)
# ==========================================
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT_ID.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_anon_key_here

# ==========================================
# BACKEND (Vercel Serverless Functions)
# ==========================================
SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT_ID.supabase.co
SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY=your_service_role_key_here
CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGIN=https://your-app.vercel.app

# ==========================================
# EXTERNAL APIS
# ==========================================
CLIST_API_TOKEN=ApiKey your_clist_token_here

# ==========================================
# HOW TO GET THESE VALUES:
# ==========================================

# 1. SUPABASE (https://supabase.com)
#    - Go to your project dashboard
#    - Click Settings > API
#    - Copy:
#      * Project URL (SUPABASE_URL / VITE_SUPABASE_URL)
#      * anon/public key (VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY)
#      * service_role key (SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY) - KEEP SECRET!

# 2. CLIST.BY (https://clist.by)
#    - Sign up for free account
#    - Go to API section
#    - Generate API token
#    - Format: ApiKey YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

# ==========================================
# VERCEL DEPLOYMENT:
# ==========================================
# Add these in: https://vercel.com/YOUR_USERNAME/YOUR_PROJECT/settings/environment-variables
# Select scope: Production, Preview, Development (all three)
# After adding, trigger a redeploy for changes to take effect
